        "Description": "5-Toubun no Hanayome\r\rFuutarou Uesugi is an ace in high school student, but leads an otherwise tough life. His standoffish personality &amp; reclusive nature have him friendless, and his father is debt-ridden. \r\rOne day, to clear his family&apos;s debt, he becoming a private tutoring gig for wealthy family&apos;s daughters with wages 5 times of market price. The girl, ITSUKI is actually a Quintuplet, so in addition to her, he must also tutor her sisters, MIKU, YOTSUBA, NINO &amp; ICHIKA.\r\rby: FAIZ51",
